# Copy this file's variable name into your Netlify site's Environment Variables
# (Site configuration > Environment variables). Never commit a real .env file.

# --- Google Sheets (read-only) ---
# Same spreadsheet triviawriterscoop.com (TWC) already owns and writes to -
# this site only ever reads from it (Form Responses 1 for events, Business
# Profiles for directory links). Use the exact same service-account JSON
# value already set as TWC's GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIALS on its own Netlify
# site - it's the same credential, just also added here so this separate
# site/build can read the same data. Paste as a single-line JSON string.
GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIALS=
